{
  "comment": "Why: the storm sectors are a machine for lightning, so the table is made of the things that conduct: armour, constructs, breezes, vexes and creepers. A lit party is a lightning rod (it draws St. Elmo's fire), a noisy one wakes the iron golem, and a silent one in the dark is stalked by a creeper's hiss.",
